OL,3,GNEWSAAward recognises major city centre
OL,4,Arevamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor work which has been carried out
OL,7,Fto transform Bradford city centre has
OL,8,Fbeen recognised with a prestigious
OL,9,Faward.
OL,11,FThe city has been named UK Design
OL,12,FCapital of the Year, fighting off
OL,13,Fcompetition from York, Cardiff and
OL,14,FPlymouth, which were also shortlisted.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
