OL,3,GNEWSAAward recognises major city centre
OL,4,Arevamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorfolk Gardens, a new 2.5 acre (10,000
OL,7,Fsq m) park, opened in the heart of
OL,8,FBradford in 2025, the same year the
OL,9,Fdistrict celebrated being the UK's City
OL,10,Fof Culture, while the nearby City Park,
OL,11,Ffamed for its mirror pool and
OL,12,Ffountains, opened to the public in
OL,13,F2012.
OL,15,FAndrew Judson, Bradford Council's
OL,16,Fexecutive member for regeneration, said
OL,17,Fit was a "huge honour" for the city
OL,18,Fcentre revamp to receive national
OL,19,Frecognition.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
